{title: Your Love Reaches}
{artist: Words by Joy Marquéz • Music by Doug Gregan}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 115}

{c: Intro}
Who can [Ab9]sep - [Db]a - [Eb]rate me from [F]You?  [C]

{c: Verse}
Who can [F]condemn me? Who can a[Dm]ccuse me?
I stand r[EbMaj7]ighteous in Your [C]sight.
You gave J[F]esus, gave us Your [Dm]own Son.
And now [EbMaj7]I stand free from [C]shame[C/Bb].

{c: Chorus}
Your love [Am7]reac[Dm]hes, reaches my [Am7]deepest n[Dm]eed.
Your love r[Ab9]ea - c[Db]hes [Eb]in-to my [F]heart.
Your love [Am7]reac[Dm]hes, reaches my [Am7]deepest [Dm]need.
Who can [Ab9]sep - [Db]a - [Eb]rate me from [F]You?

